A friend of mine and a hooked nethack player suggested that a newspaper
be added to the game.  This scroll would have stories about one or two
"legendary" or dead adventurers.  With respect to dead adventurers, there
could perhaps be rumors or hints or lies about what they were carrying.

What I'm getting at is that this shouldn't be some huge fortune cookie.
The newspaper should be *news*, information about the fates of adventurers
precedeeing the player and information about aspects of the game that change
every time (e.g. potion colors and scroll labels)

I think implementing this would in part require a database that gets updated
at the end of each game.  A number of templates for stories could be stored 
statically and then filled in when the newspaper was read.


